WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.050
Luke writes that Jesus is taken up,
and a cloud hides him from sight.

2
00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:07.470
His followers go back into the city.

3
00:00:07.520 --> 00:00:09.780
They wait, and they pray.

4
00:00:09.830 --> 00:00:12.800
Ten days later comes the
Jewish Feast of Weeks,

5
00:00:12.850 --> 00:00:14.530
a harvest festival.

6
00:00:14.580 --> 00:00:17.770
Pilgrims from every
nation fill the streets.

7
00:00:17.820 --> 00:00:20.010
Suddenly there is a sound like a rushing,

8
00:00:20.060 --> 00:00:23.620
mighty wind, and what
look like tongues of fire.

9
00:00:23.670 --> 00:00:26.400
And the group starts preaching in public.

10
00:00:26.450 --> 00:00:28.120
So what changed?

11
00:00:28.170 --> 00:00:31.410
In this mission, you'll
follow the map Acts sets out,

12
00:00:31.460 --> 00:00:34.750
from Jerusalem to the
uttermost parts of the earth.

13
00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:37.190
Then you'll decode the festival's symbols,

14
00:00:37.240 --> 00:00:40.450
from wind and fire to the tower of Babel.

15
00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:43.900
Your mission: find out what
changed the waiting group,

16
00:00:43.950 --> 00:00:45.170
and why it mattered.
